# 前端路由

### 获取用户路由数据
GET {{url}}/route/getUserRoutes
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:{{token}}

### 路由是否存在 (不需要权限)
GET {{url}}/route/isRouteExist?routeName=manage
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 获取固定的路由数据(不需要权限)
GET {{url}}/route/getConstantRoutes
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
